  "notes": [
    "Irregular -ER verb with an *e→ie* stem change (same pattern as *entender*, *encender*): the stressed *e* becomes *ie* everywhere except nosotros/nosotras and the Pretérito Indefinido/Imperfecto/Futuro/Condicional, which stay fully regular",
    "Past participle: *ascendido* (regular)",
    "Two common senses: literal \"to ascend/climb\" — *el humo asciende* (the smoke rises), *ascender la montaña* (to climb the mountain) — and figurative \"to be promoted\" — *lo ascendieron a director* (he was promoted to director)",
    "Related: *ascenso* (promotion, ascent), *ascensor* (elevator), *descender* (to descend — opposite, same stem-change pattern)"
  ],
